  "reference": "2 Samuel 1",
  "verseCount": 18,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "1",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "2SA 1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "1",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 1:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "After Saul's death David came back from his victory over the Amalekites and stayed in Ziklag for two days. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.1.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 1:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The next day a young man arrived from Saul's camp. To show his grief, he had torn his clothes and put earth on his head. He went to David and bowed to the ground in respect. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.1.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.1.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 1:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "David asked him, “Where have you come from?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.1.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 1:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“I have escaped from the Israelite camp,” he answered.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.1.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 1:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.1.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 1:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Tell me what happened,” David said.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.1.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 1:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Our army ran away from the battle,” he replied, “and many of our men were killed. Saul and his son Jonathan were also killed.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.1.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 1:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.1.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 1:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“How do you know that Saul and Jonathan are dead?” David asked him.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.1.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 1:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.1.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 1:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.1.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.1.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1SA.31.1+1SA.31.2+1SA.31.3+1SA.31.4+1SA.31.5+1SA.31.6"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Sam 31.1–6",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1CH.10.1+1CH.10.2+1CH.10.3+1CH.10.4+1CH.10.5+1CH.10.6"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Chr 10.1–6",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He answered, “I happened to be on Mount Gilboa, and I saw that Saul was leaning on his spear and that the chariots and horsemen of the enemy were closing in on him. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.1.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.1.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 1:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then he turned round, saw me, and called to me. I answered, ‘Yes, sir!’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.1.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.1.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 1:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He asked who I was, and I told him that I was an Amalekite. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.1.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.1.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 1:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then he said, ‘Come here and kill me! I have been badly wounded, and I'm about to die.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.1.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.1.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 1:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "So I went up to him and killed him, because I knew that he would die anyway as soon as he fell. Then I took the crown from his head and the bracelet from his arm, and I have brought them to you, sir.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.1.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.1.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 1:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.1.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.1.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 1:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "David tore his clothes in sorrow, and all his men did the same. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.1.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 1:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "They grieved and mourned and fasted until evening for Saul and Jonathan and for Israel, the people of the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.1.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.1.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", because so many had been killed in battle.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.1.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.1.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 1:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.1.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.1.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 1:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "David asked the young man who had brought him the news, “Where are you from?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.1.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.1.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 1:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He answered, “I'm an Amalekite, but I live in your country.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.1.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.1.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 1:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.1.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.1.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 1:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "David asked him, “How is it that you dared to kill the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.1.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.1.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "'s chosen king?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.1.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.1.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 1:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then David called one of his men and said, “Kill him!” The man struck the Amalekite and mortally wounded him, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.1.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.1.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 1:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and David said to the Amalekite, “You brought this on yourself. You condemned yourself when you admitted that you killed the one whom the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.1.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.1.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " chose to be king.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.1.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.1.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 1:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.1.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.1.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 1:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "David sang this lament for Saul and his son Jonathan, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.1.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.1.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 1:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JOS.10.13"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Josh 10.13",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and ordered it",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.1.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.1.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1.18",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "One ancient translation",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "it",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "; Hebrew",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "the bow.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " to be taught to the people of Judah. (It is recorded in ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.1.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.1.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ".)",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.1.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.1.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
